 ],
 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-regular-font-size wp-elements-363befecc45b12cf9c2942678ea580c8\">4 MOËT &amp; CHANDON tulipán alakú pezsgőspohár, MOËT pezsgőspoharak, amelyek kivehetőek a szárukról</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Eredeti francia bárfelszerelés Champagne régiójából.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>4 luxus MOET tulipán alakú pezsgőspohár.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>A gravírozott üvegpoharak levehetők a rózsaszín akril szárról, és külön is lehűthetők jégen.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A tulipánok vastag akril talapzatra helyezhetők.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Mindegyik pezsgőspohár és a talapzat gravírozott: „Moët &amp; Chandon” alapítva 1743.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>A bemutatott termék egy vintage darab, a tulipánok szárain kisebb kopások láthatók, és az akril talapzat alján egy apró repedés van, ami nehezen észrevehető, de jelen van.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>ChampagneClub Budapest – „A buborékok eltűnnek, a pezsgő tartozékok megmaradnak.”</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-larger-font-size\"><strong>4 MOET CHANDON tulip flutes MOET champagne glasses that can be removed from the stem and put on ice Authentic French barware from Champagne</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-regular-font-size wp-elements-1542a11673bba1030743763074471dab\">4 luxury MOET tulip champagne flutes.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The engraved glass tumblers can be removed from the Pink acrylic stem and can be iced separately.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The tulips can be set on a thick acrylic pedestal.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Each champagne flute and their base are engraved: “Moêt &amp; Chandon” founded in 1743</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The presented product is a vintage piece, with minor wear on the stems of the tulips and a small crack on the underside of the acrylic base, which is difficult to notice but is present.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right\"><strong>ChampagneClub Budapest &#8211; &#8222;Bubbles Fade Accessories Stay”</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The original French bar accessories from Champagne.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Upon request, we can provide additional detailed photo documentation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Any bottles shown in the pictures are for decoration and to show dimensions. They are not part of the lot.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Browse our range of champagne accessories, bar equipment and champagne souvenirs!<br>SursumVivere Pannonia</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-8 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-regular-font-size\"><strong>Fémbútorok gyártása egyedi megrendelés alapján. Ha megálmodott magának egy különleges méretű, kialakítású, színű lakberendezési tárgyat, mi megvalósítjuk. Tervezés, kivitelezés, helyszíni beszerelés.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Manufacturing of metal furniture based on custom orders. If you have dreamed of a unique piece of furniture in a special size, design, or color, we will bring it to life. Design, production, and on-site installation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-regular-font-size\"><strong><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\">www.sursumvivere.hu</a></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-9 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sursumvivere\"></a></figure>\n",
